    "summary": "- Billing period boundaries are computed from the anchor (StartedAt, or TrialEnd for trials) as `anchor + n months/years`, clamped to the last day of a shorter month. The anchor never drifts, and each period ends where the next one starts.\n- `RenewDue` catches up missed periods in order, creating one invoice per period, with boundaries independent of when the job runs. Times are UTC.\n- New tests cover Jan 31 monthly, Feb 29 yearly, trial anchors, UTC conversion, and a late job with two missed periods. `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` all pass.",
